    "private_chat_agreement": "Unanimously agreed to maintain 100% harmonious deep cover in Round 5. No pushback, no contrarian moves, no premature traps. Let the faithful completely relax and settle into autopilot before launching our move in Round 6.",
    "colleague_13_my_role": "Post a brief, collegial public response early/mid-round. Affirm satisfaction that all 15 members are united on SWAM, validate the thoroughness of the group's deductive work on all four clues, and blend in seamlessly as an aligned participant.",
    "colleagues_7_and_14_role": "Post short, low-key confirming statements staggered across the round, avoiding any coordinated appearance.",
    "demeanor": "Satisfied, collaborative, concise, completely in step with group consensus."
  }
}

